.\n.\n.\nすごく好きだもんね。\n.\n.\n.\n.\nたんたんたん ゆったんたん\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-26841":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月に入って もうすぐクリスマス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで 昨日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいキャンドル出しました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/12/04/2309813/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※写メの角度的にこの配置にしたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際にはこんな壁の近くには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置いていません＼(◎o◎)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスツリーのキャンドルと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TOCCAのキャンドルと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にIKEAで購入したキャンドル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、左上のキャンドルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が作ったものなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔ある番組でキャンドルを作ろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という企画で作らせていただいて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり初期の方だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルタイムで見たよーって方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"居たりするのかな(*^^*)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿体なくて付けてなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前整理していたら出てきたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い切って付けてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty